  "body": "_Exosphere: A simple CLI and TUI driven application that offers patch reporting for remote unix systems_\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\nCorrects a compatibility issue with the output of `pkg` >=2.8, which would prevent security updates from being correctly read at all, and silently dropped from reports.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* FreeBSD: Fix parsing for pkg 2.8 by @mrdaemon in https://github.com/mrdaemon/exosphere/pull/406\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mrdaemon/exosphere/compare/v3.0.3...v3.0.4",
